  7  [chat] Product card image ratio: card-gallery.liquid sets --gallery-aspect-ratio inline (adapt/portrait
         /square/landscape only). For a custom fixed ratio (e.g. Figma 426/310), override the variable in sectio
     n-scoped CSS with !important; pair with --product-media-fit: contain !important to avoid cropping (slid
          eshow-slide sets cover inline).
     8  [chat] Filters drawer on desktop: blocks/filters.liquid always renders the #filters-drawer dialog when 
          enable_filtering is true — any button with on:click="#filters-drawer/showDialog" opens it on desktop to
        o. But the drawer's dialog-component also carries .facets-block-wrapper--vertical, so base.css's grid-o

  ffsetrule(.facets-block-wrapper--vertical:not(.hidden)~.main-collection-grid)stillmatchesthrough

  thedrawersiblingevenwhenthesidebarpaneishidden—needsanid-scopedgrid-columnoverrideint

  hesection.

 9 [chat]HorizonproductgridcolumncountisNOTasetting—it'sauto-fillminmax(card-size,1fr)fromu

  til-product-grid-card-size.Foranexactcolumncount(e.g.3-upPLP),override--product-grid-columns-

  desktop:repeat(3,1fr)witha#shopify-section-{id}scopedrule.

 10 +[chat] Facet changes morph the ENTIRE collection section HTML (facets.js → sectionRenderer.renderSectio

    +n → morph), so any UI state stored as a class/attribute inside the section (e.g. a toggled filter panel

    +) is wiped on every filter click. Persist such state as a class on <body> and drive visibility with bod

    +y-class-scoped CSS.                                                                                    

 11 +[chat] Inline collapsible PLP filter panel (client design: filters open BESIDE the grid, not as overlay

    + drawer): render the vertical facets pane normally, default it to display:none on desktop, reveal via b

    +ody.filters-panel-open. base.css auto-narrows .main-collection-grid whenever a non-hidden .facets-block

    +-wrapper--vertical sibling exists (the always-rendered #filters-drawer dialog matches too!), so gate th

    +e full-width grid-column override on body:not(.filters-panel-open) + a .facets-block-wrapper--collapsib

    +le sibling selector.                                                                                   


